linc.cis.upenn.edu  has nethack for many differet systems. along with the source
code.

risc.ua.edu has a very good hack manual available for FTP.  It's in
pub/games/solutions called manual.hack.  It lists all mosters and their food
value and what they can do for you, and a whole bunch of other stuff.
There are alot of spoilers in there, but the big spoilers are sectioned off
so you can't accidentally read them.  Very interesting to read.

